{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Home for Friends: Beloved Pets Collector's Edition",
    "steam_appid": 3851370,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851370/extras/40945dede9248d2e880205937b110f8f.avif?t=1753202058\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Home for Friends: Beloved Pets invites players into a heartwarming atmosphere inspired by the spirit of animal rescue. While a light narrative frames your adventure, the core experience is a blend of engaging puzzles and hidden object gameplay. The journey is less about unfolding a tale and more about the joy of interactive discovery and task completion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with Violet, Paul, and their loyal pup Coop as you bring new life to a once-forgotten shelter. Care for a variety of adorable animals\u2014from energetic puppies to curious lemurs\u2014each with its own charm. Help them settle in, bond with new families, and ultimately find a loving forever home. Create beautiful environments for your furry guests to grow and thrive as you progress through a heartwarming mission of compassion and connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your intuition guide you through a wide variety of puzzles, from classic hidden object scenes to creative mini-games. Every level presents a new challenge that rewards both attentiveness and a love for charming details. With each task completed, your sanctuary flourishes.<i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Dozens of hidden object scenes filled with delightful surprises</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Mini-games and puzzles designed to entertain and relax</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Cozy, customizable sanctuary environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e A rich collection of collectibles and hidden surprises</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Stunning concept art, wallpapers, and a relaxing original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e In-game achievements for completionists and explorers alike</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break, dive in, and discover just how good it feels to be a friend to those who need it most, your shelter of smiles awaits!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851370/extras/40945dede9248d2e880205937b110f8f.avif?t=1753202058\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Home for Friends: Beloved Pets invites players into a heartwarming atmosphere inspired by the spirit of animal rescue. While a light narrative frames your adventure, the core experience is a blend of engaging puzzles and hidden object gameplay. The journey is less about unfolding a tale and more about the joy of interactive discovery and task completion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with Violet, Paul, and their loyal pup Coop as you bring new life to a once-forgotten shelter. Care for a variety of adorable animals\u2014from energetic puppies to curious lemurs\u2014each with its own charm. Help them settle in, bond with new families, and ultimately find a loving forever home. Create beautiful environments for your furry guests to grow and thrive as you progress through a heartwarming mission of compassion and connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your intuition guide you through a wide variety of puzzles, from classic hidden object scenes to creative mini-games. Every level presents a new challenge that rewards both attentiveness and a love for charming details. With each task completed, your sanctuary flourishes.<i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Dozens of hidden object scenes filled with delightful surprises</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Mini-games and puzzles designed to entertain and relax</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Cozy, customizable sanctuary environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e A rich collection of collectibles and hidden surprises</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Stunning concept art, wallpapers, and a relaxing original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e In-game achievements for completionists and explorers alike</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break, dive in, and discover just how good it feels to be a friend to those who need it most, your shelter of smiles awaits!</p>",
    "short_description": "Rescue adorable pets, solve puzzles, and build the perfect sanctuary in this cozy hidden object adventure!",
